# Shoulder on FHIR — Clinical Data (Patients, Conditions, Procedures, Observations)
# VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# Tenant endpoint: http://localhost:8080/fhir/DEFAULT
#
# Seed patients are the two longitudinal cases auto-loaded by build-and-deploy.sh
# (seed/bundles/<slug>/):
#   PAT-LONG-001  Anna Müller   — degenerative, single-tendon, statutory insurance
#   PAT-LONG-002  Kemal Demir   — traumatic, two-tendon, workers' compensation
#
# HAPI assigns resource IDs at load time, so this file looks patients up by
# identifier rather than hardcoding a resource ID that would go stale on the
# next --clean rebuild.

@base = http://localhost:8080/fhir/DEFAULT

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PATIENTS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all patients (summary)
GET {{base}}/Patient?_summary=true&_count=20
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Search patient by family name
GET {{base}}/Patient?name=demir
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Get Anna Müller by identifier
GET {{base}}/Patient?identifier=PAT-LONG-001
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Get Kemal Demir by identifier
GET {{base}}/Patient?identifier=PAT-LONG-002
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Everything for Kemal Demir (all linked resources — resolve the resource id from the identifier search above)
GET {{base}}/Patient?identifier=PAT-LONG-002&_revinclude=*
Accept: application/fhir+json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CONDITIONS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all conditions (summary)
GET {{base}}/Condition?_summary=true
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Conditions by RotatorCuffCondition profile
GET {{base}}/Condition?_profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-condition
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Kemal Demir's rotator cuff condition (fixed logical id — see kemal_demir_01_registration.json)
GET {{base}}/Condition/kemal-demir-rc-tear
Accept: application/fhir+json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PROCEDURES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all procedures (summary)
GET {{base}}/Procedure?_summary=true
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Procedures by RotatorCuffProcedure profile
GET {{base}}/Procedure?_profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-procedure
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Kemal Demir's surgical repair (fixed logical id — see kemal_demir_02_surgery.json)
GET {{base}}/Procedure/kemal-demir-surgery-2024-03-18
Accept: application/fhir+json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OBSERVATIONS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all observations (summary)
GET {{base}}/Observation?_summary=true&_count=50
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Observations by category: clinical exam
GET {{base}}/Observation?category=exam
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Observations by category: imaging
GET {{base}}/Observation?category=imaging
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Observations by category: survey / PROMs
GET {{base}}/Observation?category=survey
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Kemal Demir's 12-month Constant-Murley score (fixed encounter id — see kemal_demir_06_followup_12mo.json)
GET {{base}}/Observation?encounter=Encounter/kemal-demir-encounter-fu-12mo&code=273383002
Accept: application/fhir+json
